               <extent xml:id="extent_1ff1b2f5">31 folios</extent>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_be70a04c">Source consists of two parts: a keyboard part and a vl./fl. part in oblong format and both parts bound together; at bottom left-hand corner of the title page 'N<rend xml:id="idm166" rend="sup">o</rend> C' and 'Stor fol.' are added in ink, presumably the first refers to Haffner's catalogue number and the second to the score.</physMedium>
            </physDesc>
